[{"title":"李养吾董教同安为作长编","author":"丘葵","text":"一元之根贞下起，勾萌甲拆春阳敷。\n千红万紫弄晴霁，忽然暗绿绕丘墟。\n霜风厉厉百物遂，枝叶剥落留根株。\n一诚通复心无愧，虽千万往犹褐夫。\n浩然之气非袭取，所要与道与义俱。\n勿正勿忘勿助长，活泼泼地惟鸢鱼。\n子思吃紧为人处，邹孟得之曰养吾。\n千载断脉无人续，往往舐痔誇得车。\n何期邑泮乃亲见，铎音之来自方壶。\n加之卿相心不动，顾乃下教青衿徒。\n古来揖逊三杯酒，至和薰蒸遍八极。\n圣门狂者得气象，童冠浴沂风舞雩。\n叹子养浩亦已久，读书窗前草不除。\n明年春风二三月，不知先生与点无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20809,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"极目","author":"丘葵","text":"群形寂无声，四野澹将夕。\n中庭聊极目，一鸟渡空碧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20810,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"步院前溪水","author":"丘葵","text":"偶出山门去，乘凉步浅沙。\n溪流盘略彴，岸沫上槎枒。\n野拓天围大，风吹日脚斜。\n吟成无与语，独立数归鸦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20811,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求约","author":"丘葵","text":"求约未能休厌繁，每于得处自难言。\n书曾过眼平心看，道不依形触目存。\n木本草根如有见，山巅水际尽逢源。\n可怜日月惟空过，休听钟声送黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20812,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"閒居","author":"丘葵","text":"树月纷纷白，溪流练练青。\n畦蔬先雨种，径草未春生。\n井近通邻汲，桥崩断客行。\n閒居寂无事，觞咏叙幽情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20813,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寻从子伯恭不遇","author":"丘葵","text":"我行独踽踽，聊复寻诸孙。\n诸孙名有役，谁复相温存。\n彼茁者汀芦，上有鹪鹩喧。\n衡门可栖迟，清风自妍暄。\n汲井欲灌圜，灌园当灌根。\n澡身欲树德，树德当树淳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20814,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和义兄诗毕忽忆竹庄石隐二老寄诗一首烦为问讯","author":"丘葵","text":"为向东林问起居，更询李白近何如。\n携琴想对青霞顶，觅句应巡碧玉除。\n无复风流陪二老，空怜憔悴似三闾。\n冰霜凛凛河流断，安得双鱼送尺书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20815,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和心泉问柳","author":"丘葵","text":"初晓晴曦为写真，嫣然一笑换千颦。\n缘谁青眼终无语，学得黄金不济贫。\n生怕蛮腰来习舞，取为蝉翳去瞒人。\n无端飞作漫天絮，撩乱东风祇自尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20816,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和所盘九日","author":"丘葵","text":"石铓如剑梦犹危，风帽桥边且任吹。\n山送落晖应恨速，月临归路不妨迟。\n欲从此夕颓如醉，试问明年健者谁。\n一笑樽前俱是客，可堪摇动菊花期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20817,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庚辰岁寓开元东罗汉阁 其二","author":"丘葵","text":"有崷者浮图，屹其插穹昊。\n有坟者古道，凄其鞠成草。\n而我独兢兢，于焉以终老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20818,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庚辰岁寓开元东罗汉阁 其一","author":"丘葵","text":"有美者杰阁，凌然跨虚空。\n有觉者彼岸，廓然大圆通。\n而我独蠢蠢，于何而适从。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20819,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怡园先生","author":"丘葵","text":"三朝秉枢要，钜文饰皇猷。\n中原争一发，忘却君父雠。\n暮年玉和堂，抱膝空隐忧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20820,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"视夜","author":"丘葵","text":"我兴视夜夜未明，抬头观星敬自生。\n万古不动惟北极，列宿环拱俱西倾。\n天光昭回泰宇定，人欲净尽灵台清。\n但能勿使旦昼牿，天理触处尽流行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20821,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金樱子 其一","author":"丘葵","text":"采采金樱子，采之不盈筐。\n佻佻双角童，相携过前岗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20822,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓鱼","author":"丘葵","text":"钓鱼如之何，亦惟钓与丝。\n为学如之何，亦惟行与知。\n择善必固执，诚意毋自欺。\n博我复约我，至之而终之。\n先民莫不然，予曷敢有亏。\n但恐寒者至，庄敬以自持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20823,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨后忆家","author":"丘葵","text":"客里诗书债，人间骨肉情。\n一春不相见，四月又还经。\n梅雨年年事，田禽夜夜声。\n直思到蒲节，方得侍亲庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20824,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"信儿有作依韵勉之","author":"丘葵","text":"母鸡啄儿粟，一啄还一呼。\n细腰日祝子，自怜族鳏孤。\n赋形在穹壤，此情谁独无。\n古来骨肉间，爱深色自愉。\n愧我无黄金，贻以竹与蒲。\n勉哉读父书，尧桀性不殊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20825,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"养疴","author":"丘葵","text":"八尺空床坐养疴，老来真是病维摩。\n虚皇大道无为尔，造物小儿如我何。\n许大乾坤无处著，这些躯壳累人多。\n何当飞入虚空里，骨肉收归土一窝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20826,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"勉吕之寿","author":"丘葵","text":"汎汎水中舟，有绋以丽维。\n荡荡人之情，有礼以执持。\n武公年九十，犹思慎其仪。\n吾侪未耄老，盍亦相箴规。\n云胡工诵说，志行乃有亏。\n此病当自省，所差只毫釐。\n勉哉为己学，先民不我欺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20827,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"独步芝山","author":"丘葵","text":"平生独往愿，颇得山林趣。\n轻阴春漠漠，淡日随行屦。\n犹嫌影趁人，特入深深处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20828,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋园桃花","author":"丘葵","text":"秋园八月开桃花，数枝冷淡无光华。\n北风萧萧吹汝寒，汝发非时谁复看。\n墙下牵月颜色鲜，故园欺汝相萦缠。\n何不藏英待时发，自有阳春三月天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20829,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"丘葵","text":"何处秋来在树间，旅中寂寞欲生寒。\n筼筜粉落见秋色，薜荔青凋带老颜。\n午枕尚犹飞豹脚，晓霜久已染鸡冠。\n流年偷向吟中换，老却诗人空等閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20830,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵廷俊毁淫祠诗以美之","author":"丘葵","text":"风霆妙流行，日月互出没。\n鬼神本良能，一气自伸屈。\n南方有妖魂，缁衣而血食。\n因讼默祈呼，桎梏脱顷刻。\n逆迪曾靡分，唯事是凶谲。\n吏有廷俊者，谓此非正直。\n宜加以鈇钺，而焚其宫室。\n予闻而壮之，作诗纪其实。\n自从政教弛，刑祸众所怵。\n凭依以为奸，白日成异物。\n廷俊慎旃哉，刚方乃终吉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20831,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送元鼎学士","author":"丘葵","text":"秋风甫联骑，朔雪又回车。\n北道奇男子，南游行秘书。\n碧幢留别句，丹陛庆新除。\n头白逢昭代，吾甘渭水渔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20832,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送熊退斋归武夷","author":"丘葵","text":"穆穆朱夫子，于道集大成。\n嗟予亦私淑，奥义终难明。\n退翁独何幸，而乃同乡生。\n虽后百馀载，玄机若亲承。\n斯人幸未坠，载道来桐城。\n平生疑惑处，喜得相考评。\n秋风吹庭树，忽然作离声。\n吾侪各衰老，何时重合并。\n愿言且少住，勿弃斯文盟。\n圣贤千万语，只在知与行。\n前修倘可企，勖哉共修程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20833,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重九","author":"丘葵","text":"病馀惟有骨崚嶒，节物催人祇自惊。\n肩比寒山为独耸，心将秋水觉双清。\n正冠落帽俱儿戏，采菊囊萸不老成。\n寂寞空斋捲书坐，欲持杯酒为谁倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20834,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重游离相院","author":"丘葵","text":"三年挂搭此丛林，今日重来思转深。\n雨过残阳如月色，风来老树作潮音。\n青山历历留人住，白鹭悠悠契我心。\n日暮荒村苦无伴，虚廊曳杖自行吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20835,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻复卿欲访诗以促之","author":"丘葵","text":"五年不见复卿回，有客传言卿欲来。\n苔石生尘亲手扫，蓬门久闭令儿开。\n苍波摇月银成片，白鹭巢松雪作堆。\n料得城中无此景，速宜相就倒金罍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20836,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中","author":"丘葵","text":"数日喉何嗄，三年肺未苏。\n自知愁不禁，谁复问何如。\n病体仍冬夜，山庄独老夫。\n恐伤阿㜷意，不敢寄家书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20837,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲生 其三","author":"丘葵","text":"莲生污泥中，其实何戢戢。\n人生有恒性，云胡狃于习。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20838,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲生 其二","author":"丘葵","text":"莲生污泥中，其叶何郁郁。\n人生有恒性，云胡蔽于欲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20839,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲生 其一","author":"丘葵","text":"莲生污泥中，其叶何青青。\n人生有恒性，云胡荡于情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20840,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龙湖庄","author":"丘葵","text":"鹤发重来客，龙湖旧日庄。\n乡心忽摇曳，春事又苍茫。\n聒聒水泉动，荒荒野日长。\n残年厌声利，吾道在耕桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20841,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄肯体","author":"丘葵","text":"三年云卧一身閒，惟有君来萧寺间。\n既是君平为世弃，不妨巢父掉头还。\n平生学道鱼千里，晚岁参禅豹一班。\n惟有圣贤真实地，吾侪努力莫辞难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20842,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄高尹","author":"丘葵","text":"桐下归来学钓鱼，岁寒相伴只鸥凫。\n何期天上郎官宰，肯到江边处士庐。\n仲蔚自怜头似雪，阿勤岂解唾成珠。\n郎君东阁相看久，莫但清吟废读书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20843,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄曾子方","author":"丘葵","text":"别来俱不饮，相忆若为情。\n交态忘贫富，相知似弟兄。\n君殊非夙昔，予亦负平生。\n惟有子城月，年年是旧盟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20844,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄槐庭","author":"丘葵","text":"吾道付沧浪，衰年尚异乡。\n畏人江草合，怀旧暮云长。\n老我已无用，如君终未忘。\n天寒无过雁，夜夜独鸣蛩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20845,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清昼","author":"丘葵","text":"谁信茅茨即玉堂，閒来清昼似宵长。\n二仪升降太虚内，一静消磨万意忙。\n忿欲俱空心自正，行持无力梦犹狂。\n可曾濯足沧江水，飞上云间千仞冈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20846,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"理欲","author":"丘葵","text":"理欲分明有两途，何为捷径世争趋。\n岂愁今古无公论，长恨乾坤有腐儒。\n甘与徂徕为鬼怪，肯犹介甫接浮图。\n从来逆迪分凶吉，于穆昭昭不可诬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20847,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"移居 其一","author":"丘葵","text":"移居山北向山南，天遣清风接笑谈。\n无数凫雏穿稻塍，一群鸂鹜语茭潭。\n鹭临清泚贪心起，莲到黄昏笑靥含。\n却忆姚家古藤下，乌巾挂了旦眠酣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20848,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雀","author":"丘葵","text":"雀在在屋上，雀在在屋下。\n喧啾各有声，食息同晨夜。\n所以异者何，仁义非外假。\n云胡不自养，乃至为物化。\n嗟余虽老倦，亦少知取舍。\n凛然保厥衷，贵富直土苴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20849,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨示儿侄 其四","author":"丘葵","text":"维天降灵雨，而或惰不耛。\n他时无敛穧，谁怜汝啼饥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20850,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨示儿侄 其二","author":"丘葵","text":"维天降灵雨，虽迟良胜无。\n百谷顿苏苏，民忧不少纾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20851,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨示儿侄 其一","author":"丘葵","text":"维天降灵雨，物物均所蒙。\n胡为兹穑稼，不知草芃芃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20852,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓石钟院作","author":"丘葵","text":"托身萧寺已踰年，独掩山门守我元。\n醉旭一生耽草圣，老叉几度发诗颠。\n雨中裹饭无嘉客，月下携瓶有老禅。\n自笑五穷挨不去，缚船未了又烧船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20853,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"煮粥","author":"丘葵","text":"清晨扫松叶，旋复烘于煁。\n汲井手自淅，咄嗟香满鬵。\n母子共一饱，茅檐乐愔愔。\n虽无滫瀡奉，庶不愧此心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20854,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禽言","author":"丘葵","text":"春泥滑滑雨潇潇，田父力作收坠樵。\n归来不敢道姑恶，我自忘却婆饼焦。\n去年冬旱无麦熟，阿婆饼焦难再得。\n门前忽报谷公来，灶冷樽空难接客。\n阿兄提壶沽浊醪，阿弟布谷披短蓑。\n不时脱却布裤渡溪水，只愁行不得也哥哥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20855,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋巨然晓意图","author":"丘葵","text":"秋曙已生白，朝暾尚潜红。\n是时天地气，正在贞元中。\n千峰虽历历，众树犹濛濛。\n群动又将作，平秩一日东。\n洒然人欲尽，天理将昭融。\n静窗自展玩，妙处谁能穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20856,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新月","author":"丘葵","text":"斗柄犹未酉，明生已自庚。\n月光本端正，人见有亏盈。\n寂感此太极，炎凉彼世情。\n徘徊花影下，独自掩柴扃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20857,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新晴","author":"丘葵","text":"新晴登㟝嵝，欣此冻初解。\n春风入条肄，枯蘖依然在。\n有美北山薇，良苗正堪采。\n我欲携短筐，悠悠隔沧海。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20858,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪桥看月","author":"丘葵","text":"当空一明镜，圆圆水中见。\n常恨溪头风，吹来皱水面。\n水面皱犹可，月碎成万片。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20859,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"磊落","author":"丘葵","text":"磊落襟怀人不知，回头堪叹亦堪悲。\n杯残炙冷穷工部，齿豁头童老退之。\n十事有九不如意，百年踰八欲何为。\n早知人世暗如漆，只合灶间食蛤蜊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20860,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题竹西独宿寮","author":"丘葵","text":"独行不愧影，独卧不愧衾。\n乐哉抱吾独，守此一片心。\n此心寂不动，众欲无由侵。\n孔昭在潜伏，所贵惟一钦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20861,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀古愚兄 其三","author":"丘葵","text":"有荷荐香，有竹荐凉。\n归哉归哉，一觥对床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20862,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物 其一","author":"丘葵","text":"雪中梅带春来，火里麦将秋至。\n一动一静互根，阴阳未尝相离。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20863,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观物 其二","author":"丘葵","text":"维天于穆不已，维圣之德之纯。\n人人皆可尧舜，物物各具乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20864,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅影","author":"丘葵","text":"冷蕊疏疏密密，老枝怪怪奇奇。\n孤高不得春力，雅淡惟应月知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20865,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"丘葵","text":"万机分子路，一局笑颜回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20866,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧归护国寺","author":"丘雍","text":"萧昂瞩馀辉，尧天命赐衣。\n石房云外启，金锡日边归。\n草腐萤光散，星中暑气微。\n抽簪期晚岁，相许扣禅扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20867,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊琼花","author":"丘静山","text":"仙种花移上苑难，紫琼谁复对花弹。\n玉魂不返东风老，二十四桥明月寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20868,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客鄞江","author":"丘静山","text":"山寒无美色，风物更凄凉。\n天地忽岁穷，弟兄皆异乡。\n酒醒衣絮薄，月死夜更长。\n闻有家书□，敲门唤隔房。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20869,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百字令 戴平轩新居，子侄新婚","author":"东冈","text":"排云拓月，向天上移下，神仙华屋。\n画栋飞檐千万落，黼黼城南乔木。\n出谷莺迁，趋庭燕尔，袍绾登科绿。\n嫦娥分付，广寒今夜花烛。\n遥想高越于门，烂盈百辆，夹道争车毂。\n春满剡溪溪上路，一任瑶华飞六。\n舆奉潘慈，楼高华萼，坐享齐眉福。\n庭槐列戟，公侯衮衮相属。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20870,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客临安怀旧都","author":"东都故老","text":"曾见宜秋辇路门，大书黄榜许游行。\n汉家宽大风流在，老去西湖乐太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20871,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访白陂陈处士 其二","author":"乐史","text":"清风不见面，白汗如波流。\n走来君洞里，云树冷飕飕。\n更泻葡萄绿，千杯沃倒愁。\n魂疑更回首，残热又为雠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20872,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏华林书院","author":"乐史","text":"能为孝义复为文，惟有君家事渐新。\n旌表已迎金殿敕，子孙常宴杏园春。\n亲情广阔追随大，鼓笛喧胜嫁娶频。\n更置书堂书万卷，不辞延待四方人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20873,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钟山寺","author":"乐史","text":"千峰夹一径，一径花枕泉。\n听泉复看花，行到钟山前。\n古寺云生屋，高僧月伴禅。\n自惭留一宿，匹马又朝天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20874,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访白陂陈处士 其一","author":"乐史","text":"沿溪复践云，云边访道人。\n水声齐入耳，山色来绕身。\n闻君话经济，使我开精神。\n少微星在此，飞诏何因循。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":20875,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]